ata-v-0b8f2e32="" class="text-center pt-0 col-sm-10 col-md-8 col-lg-8 col-xl-12 col-12"><!----></div><div data-v-0b8f2e32="" justify="center" class="text-center pb-0 col-sm-10 col-md-8 col-lg-8 col-xl-8 col-12"><form data-v-0b8f2e32="" novalidate="novalidate" action="/" method="GET" class="v-form"><!----><div data-v-0b8f2e32="" class="v-input v-input--dense theme--light v-text-field v-text-field--single-line v-text-field--solo v-text-field--solo-flat v-text-field--is-booted v-text-field--enclosed v-text-field--outlined v-text-field--placeholder"><div class="v-input__control"><div class="v-input__slot"><fieldset aria-hidden="true"><legend><span>​</span></legend></fieldset><div class="v-text-field__slot"><input name="url" aria-label="Video link" id="input-62" placeholder="Enter a link to download subtitles. Ex: https://youtu.be/rN7yhDl1cuk" type="text"></div><div class="v-input__append-inner"><button data-v-0b8f2e32="" type="button" class="ds-tap-target v-btn v-btn--flat v-btn--icon v-btn--round theme--light v-size--small" title="Paste" aria-label="Paste"><span class="v-btn__content"><i data-v-0b8f2e32="" aria-hidden="true" class="v-icon notranslate material-icons theme--light" style="font-size: 16px;">content_paste</i></span></button></div></div><div class="v-text-field__details"><div class="v-messages theme--light"><div class="v-messages__wrapper"></div></div></div></div><div class="v-input__append-outer"><button data-v-0b8f2e32="" type="submit" class="mb-5 v-btn v-btn--depressed theme--light v-size--default primary" title="Download" style="height: 40px; min-width: 44px; top: -7px;"><span class="v-btn__content"><i data-v-0b8f2e32="" aria-hidden="true" class="v-icon notranslate material-icons theme--light">file_download</i></span></button></div></div></form></div><div data-v-0b8f2e32="" class="text-center pb-0 col-sm-10 col-md-8 col-lg-8 col-xl-8 col-12"><a data-v-0b8f2e32="" href="https://www.aiarty.com/ai-denoise-image/?ttref=2505-aia-oth-itl-dhm" rel="nofollow"><picture data-v-0b8f2e32=""><source data-v-0b8f2e32="" srcset="/img/banner-aiarty-video.webp" type="image/webp"><img data-v-0b8f2e32="" src="/img/banner-aiarty-video.jpg" alt="Upscale Images to 4K Free" width="728" height="90" style="max-width: 100%; height: auto;"></picture></a></div><div data-v-0b8f2e32="" class="text-center pb-0 col-sm-10 col-md-8 col-lg-8 col-xl-8 col-12"><!----><div data-v-0b8f2e32="" id="ds-qc-header-homepage-mobile" style="min-height: 1px;"></div></div></div></div><!----><div data-v-0b8f2e32="" class="container mb-3 pa-0 pb-3"><div data-v-3b3cb816="" data-v-0b8f2e32="" class="container ds-home"><div data-v-3b3cb816="" class="layout wrap"><div data-v-3b3cb816="" class="flex mb-4 xs12"><div data-v-3b3cb816="" class="row justify-center"><div data-v-3b3cb816="" class="col-sm-10 col-md-8 col-lg-8 col-12"><div data-v-3b3cb816="" class="text-center mb-3"><i data-v-3b3cb816="" aria-hidden="true" class="v-icon notranslate mr-2 align-middle ds-heading-icon material-icons theme--light primary--text" style="font-size: 36px;">save_alt</i><h1 data-v-3b3cb816="" class="headline font-weight-bold d-inline-block align-middle"> Download Subtitles for Free </h1></div><p data-v-3b3cb816="" class="subheading font-weight-regular">DownSub is a free online <span style="background-color: rgba(12, 242, 143, .2)">subtitle downloader</span> that lets you extract subtitles directly from YouTube, Viki, Viu, WeTV, iQiyi, Hotstar, Dailymotion and 50+ video sites. Supports all major formats: <strong>SRT, VTT, TXT</strong>.<br><br>No extensions or software required - simply paste the video URL and click Download.</p></div></div></div><div data-v-3b3cb816="" class="flex mb-6 xs12"><div data-v-3b3cb816="" class="text-center"><i data-v-3b3cb816="" aria-hidden="true" class="v-icon notranslate mr-2 align-middle ds-heading-icon material-icons theme--light primary--text" style="font-size: 36px;">info_outline</i><h2 data-v-3b3cb816="" class="headline font-weight-bold d-inline-block align-middle"> How to use </h2></div><div data-v-3b3cb816="" class="row"><div data-v-3b3cb816="" class="col-sm-6 col-md-6 col-lg-6 col-12"><div data-v-3b3cb816="" class="text-center mb-3"><i data-v-3b3cb816="" aria-hidden="true" class="v-icon notranslate mr-2 align-middle ds-heading-icon material-icons theme--light primary--text" style="font-size: 36px;">file_copy</i><h2 data-v-3b3cb816="" class="title font-weight-bold d-inline-block align-middle"> Copy-paste </h2></div><p data-v-3b3cb816="" class="subheading font-weight-regular">1. <strong>Paste</strong> the link of video you want to download subtitles. <br>2. Click <strong>Download</strong> button to begin extracting subtitles. <br>3. Select the subtitles format and language you want to download, then click <strong>Download</strong> button.</p></div><div data-v-3b3cb816="" class="col-sm-6 col-md-6 col-lg-6 col-12"><div data-v-3b3cb816="" class="text-center mb-3"><i data-v-3b3cb816="" aria-hidden="true" class="v-icon notranslate mr-2 align-middle ds-heading-icon material-icons theme--light primary--text" style="font-size: 36px;">edit</i><h2 data-v-3b3cb816="" class="title font-weight-bold d-inline-block align-middle"> Tricks </h2></div><div data-v-3b3cb816="" class="subheading font-weight-regular mb-4"><span data-v-3b3cb816="">Add <span class="red--text font-weight-bold">subtitle.to/</span>  before the URL and press <strong>Enter</strong>  <br></span><div data-v-38cc36a0="" data-v-3b3cb816="" aria-hidden="true" class="ds-trick-bar mb-2"><div data-v-38cc36a0="" class="ds-trick-bar__field"><i data-v-38cc36a0="" aria-hidden="true" class="v-icon notranslate ds-trick-bar__icon material-icons theme--light" style="font-size: 16px;">public</i><span data-v-38cc36a0="" class="ds-trick-bar__url"><mark data-v-38cc36a0="">subtitle.to/</mark><span data-v-38cc36a0="" class="ds-dim">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dQw4w9WgXcQ</span></span></div></div><span data-v-3b3cb816="">Or add <span class="red--text font-weight-bold">subtitle.to/</span>  between the URL and press <strong>Enter</strong>  <br></span><div data-v-38cc36a0="" data-v-3b3cb816="" aria-hidden="true" class="ds-trick-bar"><div data-v-38cc36a0="" class="ds-trick-bar__field"><i data-v-38cc36a0="" aria-hidden="true" class="v-icon notranslate ds-trick-bar__icon material-icons theme--light" style="font-size: 16px;">public</i><span data-v-38cc36a0="" class="ds-trick-bar__url"><span data-v-38cc36a0="" class="ds-dim">https://</span>www.<mark data-v-38cc36a0="">subtitle.to/</mark><span data-v-38cc36a0="" class="ds-dim">youtube.com/watch?v=dQw4w9WgXcQ</span></span></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-v-3b3cb816="" class="flex mb-6 xs12"><div data-v-3b3cb816="" class="text-center"><i data-v-3b3cb816="" aria-hidden="true" class="v-icon notranslate mr-2 align-middle ds-heading-icon material-icons theme--light primary--text" style="font-size: 36px;">list_alt</i><h2 data-v-3b3cb816="" class="headline font-weight-bold d-inline-block align-middle"><a data-v-3b3cb816="" href="/sites" class="ds-heading-link">Supported Sites</a></h2></div><ul data-v-3b3cb816="" class="text-center ds-site-links"><li data-v-3b3cb816=""><a data-v-3b3cb816="" href="/sites/altbalaji" class="ds-site-link">Altbalaji</a></li><li data-v-3b3cb816=""><a data-v-3b3cb816="" href="/sites/bilibili" class="ds-site-link">Bilibili</a></li><li data-v-3b3cb816=""><a data-v-3b3cb816="" href="/sites/brightcove" class="ds-site-link">Brightcove</a></li><li data-v-3b3cb816=""><a data-v-3b3cb816="" href="/sites/dailymotion" class="ds-site-link">Dailymotion</a></li><li data-v-3b3cb816=""><a data-v-3b3cb816="" href="/sites/dimsum" class="ds-site-link">Dimsum</a></li><li data-v-3b3cb816=""><a data-v-3b3cb816="" href="/sites/ondemandchina" class="ds-site-link">Ondemandchina</a></li><li data-v-3b3cb816=""><a data-v-3b3cb816="" href="/sites/erosnow" class="ds-site-link">Erosnow</a></li><li data-v-3b3cb816=""><a data-v-3b3cb816="" href="/sites/drive" class="ds-site-link">Google Drive</a></li><